{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Hear, O you who swallow up</b> — like שאפני אנוש, שאׁאפה רוח." "<b>And to make cease</b> — להשבית, like לשמיד, and the lamed is opened to indicate the heh; the sense is להשבית להכריתם."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {1 "'The lamed is opened' (נפתח הלמ\"ד) refers to the lamed taking a kamatz gadol (full vowel) rather than a shva, marking it as the prefixed ל of infinitive construct with a dagesh in the following letter; the resulting form לשָׁבִית functions as להַשְׁבִּית."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:34.786335334Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}